// Combat AI profiles, read by the Fenia combat AI (dreamland_fenia/utils/combat ai).
// Profile names: a-z, 0-9, _ only. Field reference: header of "utils/combat ai"
// and "utils/combat ai: moves". Texts are RU; EN/UA via the catalog, section
// "utils/combat ai". Integers only (Fenia has no floats).
// tier_normal (tiers 6-8) and tier_trash (9) drive spells only, melee stays
// with the random pick in global/onFightAI/ai_basic (no blunders: those are
// melee-round slips).
// tier_elite/tier_champion/tier_boss: templates the tier AI fills with each
// mob's own toolbox (.tmp.cai.tierProfile). tier_spells: spell groups by class
// act; spell_damtypes: spell -> .tables.damage_table name (Fenia cannot read
// it from the spell); spell_prayers: prayer-only spells; spell_rules: who a
// spell can hurt (vict) and who can cast it usefully (caster).
// spell_tiers: attack spell -> damage tier from its skill XML <tier>;
// spell_tier_weight[tier]: % of a tier-3 nuke's damage at L75, so the tier
// AI casts the strongest first. tier_spells debuffs: first = cast first.
// Champion+ end with strikes (one more blow on a round no move fired); boss
// and legend try rend (tear off the target's sanctuary after a tool landed).
